WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:01,220
You tell the children

2
00:00:01,220 --> 00:00:02,620
Auntie will bring her a gift tomorrow

3
00:00:05,780 --> 00:00:06,780
Girl, don’t get me wrong.

4
00:00:06,780 --> 00:00:08,180
They are here to help move things

5
00:00:08,180 --> 00:00:23,240
Don't you have anything else to bring? I want to inspect the goods first. Eleven items, forty pounds of grains, fifty-two pounds of whole grains, a little girl.

6
00:00:23,240 --> 00:00:24,840
I have a few friends who also want to switch

7
00:00:24,840 --> 00:00:26,040
Will you accept it again in the future?

8
00:00:27,120 --> 00:00:28,320
Come every five days

9
00:00:28,320 --> 00:00:29,920
It’s still this time and this place

10
00:00:29,920 --> 00:00:31,120
But the thing must be real

11
00:00:31,120 --> 00:00:32,320
Fool me with fakes

12
00:00:32,320 --> 00:00:33,320
Transaction is interrupted immediately

13
00:00:33,320 --> 00:00:34,320
Understand, understand
